WEBVTT

00:00:06.357 --> 00:00:08.484
PANSY:
What are you waiting for?

00:00:08.526 --> 00:00:09.860
Someone grab him.

00:00:18.786 --> 00:00:20.704
FILCH:
Students out of bed.

00:00:21.497 --> 00:00:23.874
Students out of bed!

00:00:23.916 --> 00:00:25.626
Students in the corridor!

00:00:25.668 --> 00:00:29.046
They are supposed to be out of bed,
you blithering idiot.

00:00:30.422 --> 00:00:31.882
Oh.

00:00:32.466 --> 00:00:33.634
Sorry, ma'am.

00:00:33.676 --> 00:00:37.680
As it happens, Mr. Filch,
your arrival is most opportune.

00:00:37.721 --> 00:00:40.182
If you would, I would like you, please...

00:00:40.224 --> 00:00:44.854
...to lead Miss Parkinson and the rest
of Slytherin House from the hall.

00:00:44.895 --> 00:00:47.398
Exactly where is it
I'll be leading them to, ma'am?

00:00:47.439 --> 00:00:50.359
The dungeons would do.

00:00:50.401 --> 00:00:52.278
[CHEERING]

00:00:52.319 --> 00:00:55.155
FILCH:
Right. Come on. Come on.

00:00:55.197 --> 00:00:58.617
I presume you have a reason for returning,
Potter. What is it you need?

00:00:58.659 --> 00:01:01.245
Time, professor.
As much as you can get me.

00:01:01.829 --> 00:01:05.416
Do what you have to do.
I'll secure the castle.

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:07.877
Potter.

00:01:09.753 --> 00:01:11.589
It's good to see you.

00:01:12.506 --> 00:01:14.842
It's good to see you too, professor.

00:01:15.426 --> 00:01:17.553
Hold the fort, Neville.

00:01:17.928 --> 00:01:20.139
[STUDENTS CHATTERING]

00:01:20.973 --> 00:01:22.975
GIRL:
Hurry up, come on!

00:01:30.608 --> 00:01:31.859
RON: Harry. Hermione and I
have been thinking.

00:01:31.901 --> 00:01:33.944
It doesn't matter if we find a Horcrux.

00:01:33.986 --> 00:01:36.238
-What do you mean?
-Unless we can destroy it.

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:37.781
RON:
So we were thinking....

00:01:37.823 --> 00:01:40.451
Ron was thinking.
It was Ron's idea. It's brilliant.

00:01:40.492 --> 00:01:43.746
You destroyed Tom Riddle's diary
with a basilisk fang, right?

00:01:43.787 --> 00:01:46.081
Me and Hermione
know where we might find one.

00:01:46.123 --> 00:01:48.083
Okay.

00:01:48.125 --> 00:01:52.004
Okay, but take this. That way you can
find me when you get back.

00:01:52.046 --> 00:01:54.256
-Where are you going?
-Ravenclaw common room.

00:01:54.298 --> 00:01:55.799
Gotta start somewhere.

00:02:01.889 --> 00:02:04.308
LUNA:
Harry. Harry!

00:02:06.393 --> 00:02:09.229
Let me get this straight.
You're giving us permission to do this?

00:02:09.271 --> 00:02:11.273
That is correct, Longbottom.

00:02:11.315 --> 00:02:12.858
To blow it up? Boom?

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:14.526
Boom!

00:02:14.568 --> 00:02:18.113
Wicked. But how on earth
are we gonna do that?

00:02:18.155 --> 00:02:20.616
Why don't you confer with Mr. Finnigan?

00:02:20.658 --> 00:02:24.328
As I recall, he has a particular proclivity
for pyrotechnics.

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:25.537
I can bring it down.

00:02:25.579 --> 00:02:27.957
That's the spirit. Now away you go.

00:02:28.832 --> 00:02:32.294
You do realize, of course, we can't keep out
You-Know-Who indefinitely.

00:02:32.336 --> 00:02:35.506
McGONAGALL: Well, that doesn't mean
we can't delay him.

00:02:36.173 --> 00:02:40.803
And his name is Voldemort, Filius.
You might as well use it.

00:02:40.844 --> 00:02:43.764
He's going to try to kill you either way.

00:02:46.016 --> 00:02:49.353
Piertotum Locomotor.

00:03:04.868 --> 00:03:06.829
Hogwarts is threatened.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:13.043
Man the boundaries. Protect us.
Do your duty to our school.

00:03:16.046 --> 00:03:19.800
I've always wanted to use that spell.

00:03:28.642 --> 00:03:31.729
Protego Maxima. Fianto Duri.
Repello Inimicum.

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:36.525
Protego Maxima. Fianto Duri.
Repello Inimicum.

00:03:36.567 --> 00:03:41.488
Protego Maxima. Fianto Duri.
Repello Inimicum.

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:42.239
Protego Maxima.

00:04:11.393 --> 00:04:15.898
-Harry, wait. I need to talk to you.
-I'm a bit preoccupied at the moment, Luna.

00:04:15.939 --> 00:04:18.734
You won't find anything
where you're going. You're wasting time.

00:04:18.776 --> 00:04:20.903
-Look, we'll talk later, okay, Luna?
-Harry.

00:04:20.944 --> 00:04:22.446
-Later.
-Harry Potter!

00:04:22.488 --> 00:04:24.448
You listen to me right now!

00:04:25.949 --> 00:04:28.994
Don't you remember what Cho said
about Rowena Ravenclaw's diadem?

00:04:29.453 --> 00:04:32.539
"There's not a person alive
who's seen it."

00:04:32.581 --> 00:04:37.294
It's obvious, isn't it?
We have to talk to someone who's dead.

00:04:47.638 --> 00:04:50.474
It's very impressive, isn't it?

00:05:05.823 --> 00:05:08.575
If you're to find her,
you'll find her down there.

00:05:08.617 --> 00:05:10.160
HARRY: Aren't you coming?
LUNA: No.

00:05:10.202 --> 00:05:12.830
I think it's best if you two talk alone.

00:05:12.871 --> 00:05:15.082
She's very shy.

00:05:41.608 --> 00:05:43.152
HARRY:
You're the Grey Lady...

00:05:43.902 --> 00:05:45.821
...the Ghost of Ravenclaw Tower.

00:05:45.863 --> 00:05:47.698
I do not answer to that name.

00:05:47.739 --> 00:05:52.452
No, I'm sorry, I'm sorry.
It's Helena, isn't it? Helena Ravenclaw.

00:05:52.494 --> 00:05:54.746
Rowena's daughter.

00:05:54.788 --> 00:05:56.957
Are you a friend of Luna's?

00:05:56.999 --> 00:05:59.042
HARRY:
Yes.

00:05:59.084 --> 00:06:01.545
And she thought you might be able
to help me.

00:06:03.463 --> 00:06:06.049
You seek my mother's diadem.

00:06:07.551 --> 00:06:09.261
Yes.

00:06:10.179 --> 00:06:11.221
That's right.

00:06:12.973 --> 00:06:17.769
Luna is kind,
unlike so many of the others.

00:06:17.811 --> 00:06:20.898
But she was wrong. I cannot help you.

00:06:25.527 --> 00:06:27.946
Wait. Please.

00:06:29.615 --> 00:06:31.700
I want to destroy it.

